{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o175b","title":"麴演蒋石斩送韩遂首","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o175b-account","label":"正文","text":"西平、金城诸将麴演、蒋石等斩韩遂送首。","evidence":["wudi-e-o175b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0342","role":"斩送","evidence":["wudi-e-o175b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0343","role":"斩送","evidence":["wudi-e-o175b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0048","role":"被斩","evidence":["wudi-e-o175b-q"]}],"place":{"text":"西平、金城","evidence":["wudi-e-o175b-q"]},"time":{"label":"建安二十年","year":215,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o175b-q","wudi-q-o173","wudi-q-b-e0a96bdd9353a663e5ab"],"chronology":"wudi-y215","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o173","basis":"建安二十年","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,997,"O175b"],"order":372},{"id":"wendi-e-o007d","title":"苏则平张进黄华叛乱","accounts":[{"id":"wendi-e-o007d-account","label":"《文帝纪》正文","text":"苏则平张进黄华叛乱","evidence":["wendi-e-o007d-q"]},{"id":"wgc-a-0-e42","label":"正文","text":"毌丘兴讨张进及叛胡","evidence":["wgc-q0186","wgc-q0011"]},{"id":"liusima-a-9cf28867f4599c2422e8","label":"正文","text":"张进执郡守举兵拒邹岐，黄华、麹演各逐故太守举兵应之","evidence":["liusima-q-7a640fc9795029a728d2"]},{"id":"liusima-a-9c3997a30d92c9dbd6bf","label":"正文","text":"张既进兵为苏则声势，则得以有功","evidence":["liusima-q-aa0eab2115d01c9efa15"]},{"id":"rensu-a-2b6475c7ce31384a7228","label":"正文","text":"麹演复结旁郡为乱","evidence":["rensu-q-708104788f9f28e00771"]},{"id":"rensu-a-60352d874d90ac8347a6","label":"正文","text":"张掖张进执太守杜通","evidence":["rensu-q-672330646ed54726015e"]},{"id":"rensu-a-123d169beda6fd401f54","label":"正文","text":"酒泉黄华不受太守辛机，进、华皆自称太守以应麹演","evidence":["rensu-q-d8ad3784f12f64f762ae"]},{"id":"rensu-a-9ad7dda6263565f054c8","label":"正文","text":"武威太守毌丘兴告急于苏则","evidence":["rensu-q-e78f512255bb183010b0"]},{"id":"rensu-a-0159ae36fe1a06c5477a","label":"正文","text":"苏则见郡中大吏及郝昭等，与羌豪帅谋议因衅击贼、违诏专断","evidence":["rensu-q-8d497aa5e12452521112"]},{"id":"rensu-a-c9594d7d6c490d9a51a8","label":"正文","text":"郝昭等从苏则之谋，发兵救武威，降其三种胡","evidence":["rensu-q-8866e3b3b3c5ef093f51"]},{"id":"rensu-a-ad538556a877165fe6f4","label":"正文","text":"苏则与毌丘兴击张进于张掖","evidence":["rensu-q-f9e1009ed308649c45ca"]},{"id":"rensu-a-4ae6b2011951f99b134e","label":"正文","text":"麹演将步骑三千迎苏则，辞来助军实欲为变，苏则诱而斩之，徇军，其党皆散走","evidence":["rensu-q-87331ef88f5f111f3e7d"]},{"id":"rensu-a-c841c2b338963c3b0645","label":"正文","text":"苏则与诸军围张掖破之，斩张进及其支党，众皆降","evidence":["rensu-q-131d2e9d4727bb8913d2"]},{"id":"rensu-a-c21a8a9b64d2d55eada7","label":"正文","text":"麹演军败后黄华惧，出所执乞降","evidence":["rensu-q-9ebd4335c7d1500f1afd"]},{"id":"rensu-a-3e269f40c17b23b4d05d","label":"正文","text":"河西平定，苏则还金城","evidence":["rensu-q-89f8773457ad9ed676b9"]},{"id":"lizang-a-9eb219047918978c7a14","label":"正文","text":"酒泉黄华、张掖张进各据其郡，欲并势","evidence":["lizang-q-6990f13f51360a8892b1"]},{"id":"lizang-a-ef1a9928a8eb4a72acac","label":"正文","text":"张恭遣从弟张华攻酒泉沙头乾齐二县，又连兵继其后为首尾之援","evidence":["lizang-q-34bd8dc4ffe56d7434c3"]},{"id":"lizang-a-17b72ca370b4d3bfa5b7","label":"正文","text":"张恭别遣铁骑二百迎吏官属，径出张掖北河，逢迎太守尹奉","evidence":["lizang-q-49bc1aa25f35e32ade60"]},{"id":"lizang-a-0b1390562eff7d27ddc4","label":"正文","text":"张进须黄华之助，华欲救进而恐恭兵击后，遂诣金城太守苏则降","evidence":["lizang-q-bbbf7e14283ba5da8cab"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0008","role":"叛后降","evidence":["wendi-e-o007d-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0009","role":"叛被斩","evidence":["wendi-e-o007d-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0010","role":"讨平","evidence":["wendi-e-o007d-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0328","role":"讨张进及叛胡","evidence":["wgc-q0186","wgc-q0011"]},{"person":"wudi-p0342","role":"逐故太守，举兵应张进","evidence":["liusima-q-7a640fc9795029a728d2"]},{"person":"liusima-p0062","role":"新任刺史，被举兵拒","evidence":["liusima-q-7a640fc9795029a728d2"]},{"person":"wgc-p0068","role":"进兵，为护羌校尉苏则声势","evidence":["liusima-q-aa0eab2115d01c9efa15"]},{"person":"wgc-p0066","role":"被执之张掖太守","evidence":["rensu-q-672330646ed54726015e"]},{"person":"rensu-p0049","role":"不得到职之酒泉太守","evidence":["rensu-q-d8ad3784f12f64f762ae"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0007","role":"预议将领；从议发兵者","evidence":["rensu-q-8d497aa5e12452521112","rensu-q-8866e3b3b3c5ef093f51"]},{"person":"liusima-p0026","role":"遣华攻二县连兵继后；遣骑逢迎尹奉","evidence":["lizang-q-34bd8dc4ffe56d7434c3","lizang-q-49bc1aa25f35e32ade60"]},{"person":"lizang-p0021","role":"攻沙头乾齐","evidence":["lizang-q-34bd8dc4ffe56d7434c3"]},{"person":"lizang-p0016","role":"被逢迎之新太守","evidence":["lizang-q-49bc1aa25f35e32ade60"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":220,"label":"延康元年五月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wendi-y220","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wendi-q-o002","basis":"延康元年五月"},"evidence":["wendi-e-o007d-q","wendi-q-o002","wendi-q-o019","wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04"]},"ordering_evidence":"wendi-e-o007d-q","source_order":[2,41,"O007d"],"order":486},{"id":"liusima-e-o095","title":"颜俊、和鸾、黄华、麹演等各举郡反，自号将军，更相攻击","accounts":[{"id":"liusima-a-a5170e324225f11894e2","label":"正文","text":"颜俊、和鸾、黄华、麹演等各举郡反，自号将军，更相攻击","evidence":["liusima-q-55605ac617f6b0187227"]},{"id":"liusima-a-925ccf4f04ec68980ecd","label":"正文","text":"颜俊遣使送母及子诣太祖为质求助","evidence":["liusima-q-9455dc2ffaad43d41769"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liusima-p0069","role":"武威，举郡反，自号将军，更相攻击；遣使送母及子诣太祖为质，求助","evidence":["liusima-q-55605ac617f6b0187227","liusima-q-9455dc2ffaad43d41769"]},{"person":"liusima-p0018","role":"张掖，举郡反，自号将军","evidence":["liusima-q-55605ac617f6b0187227"]},{"person":"wendi-p0008","role":"酒泉，举郡反，自号将军","evidence":["liusima-q-55605ac617f6b0187227"]},{"person":"wudi-p0342","role":"西平，举郡反，自号将军","evidence":["liusima-q-55605ac617f6b0187227"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"受质被求助","evidence":["liusima-q-9455dc2ffaad43d41769"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liusima-q-55605ac617f6b0187227","liusima-q-9455dc2ffaad43d41769"]},"ordering_evidence":"liusima-q-55605ac617f6b0187227","source_order":[15,142,0],"order":3293},{"id":"rensu-e-o021","title":"西平麹演叛称护羌校尉，苏则勒兵讨之，演恐乞降","accounts":[{"id":"rensu-a-6401d5df28599a3b2be3","la